{"at":"2026-02-18T16:02:28.161Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":621,"status":"published","language":"es","path":"/es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/import-properties/","title":"Import Properties","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tListing a Property\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Import Properties</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 1 minute\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t969 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10426\" class=\"elementor elementor-10426\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcf617d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dcf617d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed1dce9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed1dce9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Import Your Listings:</strong></p><ol><li><p>During sign-up make sure to have your import URL from your current property listing company. The URL should point to an XML feed containing only your <strong>own property data. &#8220;own properties&#8221;</strong></p></li><li><p>Paste the import URL to start the import process. Our software handles all major formats seamlessly. (For any issues, please contact support)</p></li><li><p>Done. Your listing will be approved, usually within a few business hours.</p></li></ol><p><strong>Please note: </strong> Imports are accepted during sign-up to quickly upload all your properties. After that, you need to update properties within the PropertyList platform and add new properties manually.</p><p>If you did not upload at sign-in and need to add your xml link please <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\">contact support</a>. </p><p> </p><div><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">To learn how to Export Properties click here</a></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/creating-a-new-listing/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - Listing a Property </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tCreating a new listing                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"Import Properties • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}